IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P2-section-2-gate`
IMPORT `P2-art-15`

-- Tests of P2-art-15.l4. Every expected value is written by hand from the text (the quoted line above each function), never from the code's output.
-- Argument order of a gated function: the date asked, the AI system, the harmonisation facts, then the facts of the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`Art 15 test the Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 15 test the Annex I system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 15 test the system placed earlier` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 15 test the system placed earlier and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE
`Art 15 test the system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 15 test Section B products facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS TRUE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 15 test Section A equivalent facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS TRUE
`Art 15 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE


§ `Article 15(1): an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity`

-- Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 15 test the Annex I system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 15 test the Annex I system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 15 test the system placed earlier` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 15 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 15 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(2): an Article 6(1) system related to Section B products meets only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 15 test the Annex I system` `Art 15 test Section B products facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 2(2) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system related to Section B products is not cut off
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test Section B products facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13): the application of Articles 9 to 15 may be limited where Section A legislation gives equivalent protection and the overall level is not reduced
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 15 test the Annex I system` `Art 15 test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(13)(b) fails (the limitation would reduce the overall level of protection): the requirement applies in full
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 15 test the Annex I system` `Art 15 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system is not limited
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of accuracy
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of robustness
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of cybersecurity
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it performs consistently in those respects throughout its lifecycle
#ASSERT `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 15 test the Annex III system` `Art 15 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Article 15(2): the Commission and benchmarks`

-- Art 15(2) the Commission has encouraged the development of benchmarks and measurement methodologies
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 15(2) the Commission has encouraged the development of benchmarks and measurement methodologies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the Commission has acted in cooperation with relevant stakeholders and organisations such as metrology and benchmarking authorities
#ASSERT `Art 15(2) the Commission has encouraged the development of benchmarks and measurement methodologies` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the Commission has encouraged, as appropriate, the development of benchmarks and measurement methodologies to address the technical aspects of how to measure the appropriate levels of accuracy and robustness set out in paragraph 1 and any other relevant performance metrics
#ASSERT `Art 15(2) the Commission has encouraged the development of benchmarks and measurement methodologies` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


